# Collision: crash into the cycle's own trail, jink left a little, turn right into the same trail
# again, then right once more, back up the bit just laid. It must not drive back over its trail:
# it stays stopped (x and y unchanged between the last two shots).
wait 17
press c 3
wait 2
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 1.5
press left
wait 0.15
press right
wait 0.3
press right
wait 0.3
shot backtrack_1
wait 1
shot backtrack_2
press down
wait 0.5
shot backtrack_iso
